{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1500880-universal-mekhet-clan-weakness","id":1500880,"title":"Universal Mekhet Clan Weakness?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-20T16:31:58-08:00","id":1500880,"title":"Universal Mekhet Clan Weakness?","content":"The clan weaknesses of Requiem are good at doing two things:<br /> <br /> 1) They disrupt the vampire's efforts to exist peacefully and make her some sort of threat to the humans around her. Sometimes that threat isn't obvious (as with the Daeva and Ventrue), but it's there.<br /> <br /> 2) They enforce the clan's character. The Nosferatu are repulsive outcasts, the Ventrue find it easy to ignore humanity, et cetera.<br /> <br /> However, the Mekhet clan weakness does neither of these. A Mekhet's bane <i>can</i> be disruptive, but there's a pretty wide gulf between getting confused at crossroads and being unable to drink from the unwilling. Likewise, it doesn't really enforce the clan's character; the weakness shapes the Mekhet as being mystical, but doesn't really get into any of the clan's issues about secrecy or self-identity.<br /> <br /> Is there a weakness which would disrupt the Mekhet requiem and provide a conflict that's in-character for the clan?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26974-dreamwave","name":"Dreamwave","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-20T17:05:45-08:00","id":1500883,"title":"","content":"My impression has generally been that having at least one specific bane that is worse for them than it would be for a vampire with the same bane from a different clan gives the Shadows something personal to <i>hide</i>, which fits perfectly well with the clan's yen for secrecy and esoteric knowledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-20T22:21:02-08:00","id":1500898,"title":"","content":"That's something I hadn't thought of. Every Mekhet having a sort of secret weak spot <i>would</i> fit with their whole theme of hiding themselves.<br /> <br /> That being said, I do kinda wish there was a way to make it more disruptive, since the other clan weaknesses sabotage the vampire's relationships with mortals. Maybe &quot;hiding oneself&quot; is too cerebral to be a direct weakness, but I'd like to make it more of an imminent conflict if it's possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26974-dreamwave","name":"Dreamwave","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T07:37:45-08:00","id":1500936,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m not sure you can have a universal weakness and keep the fact that their weakness is something they keep secret. Also I'm not sure the Gangrel weakness impacts relationships with mortals more than the Mekhet does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T17:04:24-08:00","id":1500975,"title":"","content":"I'm told that Rose originally wanted to make the Hollow Mekhet the default, because there's a lot you can do with that bane to disrupt a vampire's Requiem and emphasize how WEIRD the Mekhet are, but it required too much explanation and system space to do it justice in the core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T19:11:07-08:00","id":1500993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1500880-universal-mekhet-clan-weakness?p=1500975#post1500975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm told that Rose originally wanted to make the Hollow Mekhet the default, because there's a lot you can do with that bane to disrupt a vampire's Requiem and emphasize how WEIRD the Mekhet are, but it required too much explanation and system space to do it justice in the core.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm suddenly struck by the notion of the Shadows' Predatory Aura as having a Long-Term Nimbus-esque Weirdness Magnet effect as a more diffuse version of having a displaced chunk of your soul out to mess with you.<br /> <br /> <br /> Separately, ostensibly in a version of the game where the Masquerade has some sort of Exposure Mechanic to hook into I feel like the Mekhet having some complication hooked onto that would be neat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-26T17:54:17-08:00","id":1501443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1500880-universal-mekhet-clan-weakness?p=1500975#post1500975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm told that Rose originally wanted to make the Hollow Mekhet the default, because there's a lot you can do with that bane to disrupt a vampire's Requiem and emphasize how WEIRD the Mekhet are, but it required too much explanation and system space to do it justice in the core.</div> </div> </div> </div>Anyone who has STed for a group with multiple Mekhet should be grateful for that lack of space, imagine having to run 5 reflections. All the other clan banes are passive in that they happen when they come up without any need for someone to actively bring them in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-17T23:59:28-07:00","id":1522736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1500880-universal-mekhet-clan-weakness?p=1501443#post1501443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Anyone who has STed for a group with multiple Mekhet should be grateful for that lack of space, imagine having to run 5 reflections. All the other clan banes are passive in that they happen when they come up without any need for someone to actively bring them in.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love the Hollow Mekhet as a bit of lore, but yeah, having two or more in a game could quickly snowball into a management nightmare for the ST. Blood Mary and Red Jack were more than enough for one chronicle i did a bunch of years back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-18T03:05:03-07:00","id":1522738,"title":"","content":"I ran a chronicle where all the characters were the result of an Ordo mass embrace, the banes they picked up made the characters stand out from their siblings so I had two reasons to be glad I didn\u2019t have a manage 4-6 reflections every week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-18T03:13:11-07:00","id":1522739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1500880-universal-mekhet-clan-weakness?p=1522738#post1522738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I ran a chronicle where all the characters were the result of an Ordo mass embrace,</div> </div> </div> </div>Any relation to the <a href=\"https://christophedia.com/Repository/nWOD-COD/1E:%20Vampire%20-%20the%20Requiem/Demo/Danse%20de%20la%20Morte.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Danse De La Morte</a>: Mary's Child 1e free introductory scenario?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-18T16:03:49-07:00","id":1522766,"title":"","content":"No it was entirely my own idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-18T20:18:01-07:00","id":1522773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1500880-universal-mekhet-clan-weakness?p=1522766#post1522766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No it was entirely my own idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to know - and to be fair, in Danse De La Morte while a Dragon was the mind behind the whole unauthorized group embrace mess, the parts involved were from several different covenants and clans, so not really the same either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-23T05:05:26-07:00","id":1523009,"title":"","content":"Originally i also wanted them to have one: However, later I realized that them being the clan of secrets it is fitting that all of them are paranoid because every one of them has a distinctive weakness. Furthermore I added more banes not necesarily tied to humanity for example taking agg from silver or wood, not being able to embrace or create ghouls etc... It helps making them be unique.<br /> <br /> However as a common weakness i also add that they count their humanity as one point lower towards resisting sunlight making them more confortable in the dark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}